menu "gPlug-mini"

config GPLUG_SIM_METER
    bool "Simulated meter data (never ship)"
    default n
    help
        Feeds the aggregator from an embedded capture instead of the meter UART.
        Selected by building with sdkconfig.sim.defaults. A production image must
        never have this set; CI verifies that by inspecting the built binary.

endmenu
